# When Wills Collide (WotG 46) without the Bottled Punch Bug: the Veridical Conflux plays the event 41 [89, 23, 1756]; a
# Punch Bug trade plays 42 [76, 0, 1267351, 120, 0, 8323092]; its finish gives the key item (1730, message 6398) and
# leaves the bug in the bag. A second Punch Bug trade, the key item held, gets no reply. The trigger now plays 29 [89,
# 6]; its finish with option 0 sets nothing down.
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrade GraubergS/onEventFinish/29 GraubergS/onEventFinish/42 WalkOfEchoes/_521/onTrigger WalkOfEchoes/onZoneIn/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/2 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/2
char zone=GraubergS pos=-140.28,-6.749,585.24 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg WhenWillsCollide current
item PunchBug
login
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # no key item: 41
finish
walk -142.28,-6.749,586.74
trade Veridical_Conflux PunchBug x1        # 42
finish                                     # the key item; the bug kept
trade Veridical_Conflux PunchBug x1        # the key item held: no 42
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # 29
finish option=0                            # not 99: stays
